graph LR
    Op["llm-d-batch-gateway-operator"]

    %% Platform chain (internal)
    RHODS["rhods-operator /<br/>opendatahub-operator"] -->|image digests via params.env| AIGW["ai-gateway-operator"]
    AIGW -->|deploys config/base| Op

    %% Go libraries
    Op -->|operator framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.23.3"]
    Op -->|API types + client| K8sLibs["k8s.io api/client-go v0.35.2"]
    Op -->|in-process render| HelmLib["helm.sh/helm/v3 v3.20.2"]
    Op -->|HTTPRoute, ReferenceGrant types| GWAPILib["gateway-api v1.5.1"]
    Op -->|Certificate type| CMLib["cert-manager v1.20.2 types"]
    Op -->|monitor types| PromOpLib["prometheus-operator v0.91.0 types"]
    Op -->|APIServer TLS types| OCPAPI["openshift/api"]
    Op -->|TLS profile + watcher| CRCommon["openshift/controller-runtime-common"]
    Op -->|custom metrics| PromClient["prometheus client_golang v1.23.2"]

    %% Embedded operand charts
    Op ==>|embedded chart + 3 images| BG["batch-gateway<br/>apiserver, processor, gc"]
    Op ==>|embedded chart + image| LLMDAsync["llm-d-async<br/>async processor"]

    %% Platform integrations
    Op -->|watch, SSA, TokenReview/SAR| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    Op -->|TLS profile get/watch| OCPCfg["config.openshift.io/APIServer"]
    Op -.->|metrics cert annotation| ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"]
    Op -.->|optional HTTPRoute, ReferenceGrant watch| GWAPI["Gateway API / platform Gateway"]
    Op -.->|optional Certificate| CertManager["cert-manager"]
    Op -.->|optional ServiceMonitor/PodMonitor/PrometheusRule| PromOp["Prometheus Operator /<br/>platform monitoring"]

    %% Operand runtime dependencies
    BG -->|job metadata| PG[("PostgreSQL")]
    BG -->|files| S3[("S3 / PVC")]
    BG -->|async queue| Redis[("Redis / Valkey")]
    LLMDAsync -->|async queue| Redis
    LLMDAsync -.->|optional SQL queue| PG
    LLMDAsync -->|inference dispatch| IGW["llm-d inference gateway / EPP"]

